  "readme": "# AI Content Studio\n\nAI-powered content generation platform built with GCP services.\n\n## Architecture\n\n- **Cloud Run**: Serverless container hosting for API and generators\n- **Vertex AI**: AI/ML models (Gemini, PaLM, Imagen)\n- **Firestore**: NoSQL database for content and users\n- **Cloud Storage**: Asset storage with CDN\n- **Pub/Sub**: Async job processing\n\n## Services\n\n### API Service\nMain REST API for content generation requests.\n\n### Text Generator\nGenerates text content using Vertex AI models (Gemini Pro, PaLM).\n\n### Image Generator\nCreates images using Imagen 2 models.\n\n### Content Processor\nAsync background processing for enrichment.\n\n## Development\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\npip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Run locally\npython services/api/main.py\n```",
